{% comment %}
@description: Trang thanh toán don hang (checkout).
@required_substrings: {% layout "layout" %}, {% block content %}, {% endblock %}
@required_ids: checkout-items, checkout-form, checkout-total, checkout-error
@notes: JS (giu nguyen) doc localStorage, bom danh sach sp tom tat vao #checkout-items, form#checkout-form co input[name=customerName]/customerPhone/customerAddress, hien tong vao #checkout-total, loi vao #checkout-error. DUOC PHEP them input dat ten tuy y vao form nay (vd <input name="secondaryPhone">) - JS tu dong gop moi input NGOAI cac field chuan thanh customFields.
{% endcomment %}
{% layout "layout" %}
{% block content %}
<section>
    <h1>...</h1>
    <div id="checkout-items"></div>
    <div id="checkout-total"></div>
    
    <form id="checkout-form">
        <input name="customerName">
        <input name="customerPhone">
        <input name="customerAddress">
        <button type="submit">Order</button>
        <div id="checkout-error"></div>
    </form>
</section>
{% endblock %}